{
    "title": "RadarNow! \u00ae",
    "description": "Discover instant weather insights with RadarNow!\u00ae. Whether you're working outdoors, enjoying a bike ride, or keen on staying updated on the current weather, RadarNow!\u00ae offers accurate, real-time animated NOAA radar images and up-to-the-minute conditions to keep you informed.\r\n\r\nRadarNow!\u00ae displays the latest National Weather Service (NWS) radar images from NOAA WSR-88D NEXRAD and TDWR sites across the US Puerto Rico, Guam, Canada, and selected regions in Mexico and the Caribbean. With optional location services on, RadarNow!\u00ae automatically displays radar data from the site nearest to you when you open the app. No searching for the weather near you, RadarNow!\u00ae drops a blue dot to show you where you are, with the weather nearby shown from the closest radar. \r\n\r\nWith RadarNow!\u00ae, you can access animated radar and local conditions centered around your current location. For an enhanced experience with advanced features, consider the \"RadarNow!\u00ae Lifetime\" pass available at $12.99. You can explore these premium features with a complimentary 5-day trial.\r\n\r\nRadarNow!\u00ae is dedicated to delivering the most accurate radar images, current conditions and hourly forecasts straight from NOAA's servers, ensuring you receive trustworthy data. For those interested in TDWR sites (higher resolution but shorter range), these are represented by aqua icons, easily selectable with a touch.\r\n\r\nFeedback or suggestions? We're here to help. Use the \"Contact us\" option within RadarNow!\u00ae (found under menu-setting-contact us). We're committed to top-tier customer service, typically responding to support requests within just ten minutes and always within two business days. Your insights inspire our continuous improvements, helping to shape today's best version of RadarNow!\u00ae.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover instant weather insights with RadarNow!\u00ae. Whether you&#39;re working outdoors, enjoying a bike ride, or keen on staying updated on the current weather, RadarNow!\u00ae offers accurate, real-time animated NOAA radar images and up-to-the-minute conditions to keep you informed.<br><br>RadarNow!\u00ae displays the latest National Weather Service (NWS) radar images from NOAA WSR-88D NEXRAD and TDWR sites across the US Puerto Rico, Guam, Canada, and selected regions in Mexico and the Caribbean. With optional location services on, RadarNow!\u00ae automatically displays radar data from the site nearest to you when you open the app. No searching for the weather near you, RadarNow!\u00ae drops a blue dot to show you where you are, with the weather nearby shown from the closest radar. <br><br>With RadarNow!\u00ae, you can access animated radar and local conditions centered around your current location. For an enhanced experience with advanced features, consider the &quot;RadarNow!\u00ae Lifetime&quot; pass available at $12.99. You can explore these premium features with a complimentary 5-day trial.<br><br>RadarNow!\u00ae is dedicated to delivering the most accurate radar images, current conditions and hourly forecasts straight from NOAA&#39;s servers, ensuring you receive trustworthy data. For those interested in TDWR sites (higher resolution but shorter range), these are represented by aqua icons, easily selectable with a touch.<br><br>Feedback or suggestions? We&#39;re here to help. Use the &quot;Contact us&quot; option within RadarNow!\u00ae (found under menu-setting-contact us). We&#39;re committed to top-tier customer service, typically responding to support requests within just ten minutes and always within two business days. Your insights inspire our continuous improvements, helping to shape today&#39;s best version of RadarNow!\u00ae.",
